              "version": 1,
              "widgetType": "text",
              "text": "## Security note\nDashboard visual filters improve exploration but are **not row-level security**. Enforce access with Unity Catalog privileges, row filters, column masks, and approved presentation views. This dashboard intentionally does not apply `patient_id` to aggregated consent-summary datasets.\n\n**Semantic colors:** Green = healthy/ready/in range · Amber = warning/attention · Red = failed/overdue/out of range · Blue = informational trend · Gray = neutral/not applicable."
